
Phase 1
{
  Focus: 
    Strengthen the Foundation

  Key Capabilities Added:
    DONE   Add proper replay mode (Abstractors can run from JSON logs instead of live input).
    DONE   Improve logging (e.g., make it easier to see the full chain of Abstractions for one frame).
    DONE   Add a simple way to generate synthetic scenarios (not just one growing blob).
    DONE   Create a basic test harness or “scenario runner”.


  Estimated Complexity:
    Medium
}


Phase 2
{
  Focus:
    Tracking & Attention

  Key Capabilities Added:
    DONE  Improve the Tracker (handle multiple objects, better state management, retirement of lost tracks).
    DONE  Make suppression more robust (use bounding boxes or regions instead of just x distance).
    DONE  Add basic temporal consistency (e.g., only trust a track after it has been seen for N frames).

  Estimated Complexity:
    Medium
}


Phase 3
{
  Focus:
    Feature Detection

  Key Capabilities Added:
    Create a ShapeAnalyzer Abstractor that looks inside TrackedRegions and detects simple shapes (starting with octagons / stop signs).
    Possibly add a color/structure Abstractor that looks for white-on-red patterns inside tracked regions.
    Make Abstractors able to request more detailed analysis of a specific region when needed.

  Estimated Complexity:
    Medium-High
}


Phase 4
{
  Focus:
    Hypothesis & Recognition

  Key Capabilities Added:
    Create an EvidenceAccumulator or HypothesisBuilder that combines TrackedRegion + shape + color evidence over multiple frames.
    Build the final StopSignDetector Abstractor that only fires when it has sufficient consistent evidence across frames.
    Add simple confidence scoring so StopSignDetected includes a confidence value that grows over time.

  Estimated Complexity:
    Medium
}


Phase 5
{
  Focus:
    Integration & Polish

  Key Capabilities Added:
    Create one or two complete end-to-end synthetic scenarios that demonstrate the full chain.
    Improve overall logging / visualization so the emergent behavior is easy to explain.
    Write a short “v1.0 Demo” document or README section showing what the system can do.
    Clean up code, add comments, and stabilize the core interfaces.

  Estimated Complexity:
    Low-Medium
}


